{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791649410,"nonce":"gnhoo2NqBXKSWh0slHk+yXwqoj8=","message":"Landed in b4fa30772178cc0a1bf024106d39b01f07b7c43e.\n\nWhere it differs from the plan:\n- The selection splits the shown text into three bound runs (before, selected, after), the selected run in a div with the selection colour, rather than a bound rect.\n- The caret canvas sits in a div with a bound translate; Canvas takes no transform.\n- The box look is one computed (`BoxLook`) behind four render bindings. It has to be read once at build to subscribe to the revision; unread, it tracked nothing and hover never repainted.\n- `blur_text_input_deferred` and `PENDING_BLUR_INPUT` are gone. With no Stateful auto POINTER_DOWN handler, a redirected OTP click never focuses the clicked slot.\n- `combobox_in_place` now forbids every subtree rebuild.\n\nTests: `tests/text_input_in_place.rs` (typing, focus and hover, scrolling, selection runs) asserts no subtree rebuild; all four fail against the old widget.\n\nFollow-ups: 0cfdd8a (text_area), e4ef8d8 (cn number_input / input_otp).","files":null}]}